1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.1 是什么</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>用户给一个开放问题 → Agent&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>自动规划研究路径 → 多轮搜索 → 阅读/筛选来源 → 综合成带引用的报告</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>代表：ChatGPT Deep Research、Perplexity、Gemini Deep Research、Claude（deep research 能力）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>价值：把「几小时的人工调研」压缩到「几分钟」。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.2 原理拆解（对照 01-08）</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>系统</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>在研究 Agent 里是什么</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>感知</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>网页抓取、PDF/文档读取、检索结果（工具型感知）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>推理</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>拆研究子问题 → 规划搜索顺序 → 评估来源可信度 → 综合</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>记忆</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>已查过的来源、中间结论、引用清单</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>行动</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>调用搜索 API、抓取页面、保存笔记</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>训练（08）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>推理模型（o1/R1 系）做深度规划；agent RL 强化「搜索-综合」轨迹</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>评测</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>引用准确性、事实保真度（幻觉是头号风险）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1.3 关键工程：防幻觉</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>引用强制</span></strong><span>：报告必须带可点击来源——「可验证」是对抗幻觉的第一防线；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>来源评估</span></strong><span>：模型对来源可信度打分（官方 &gt; 二手 &gt; 社区）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>迭代校验</span></strong><span>：多轮搜索中交叉验证矛盾信息（衔接推理反思 02 篇）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：研究 Agent = 推理模型 × 检索 × 引用纪律</span></strong><span>它本质是「带工具的推理任务」：思考深度（o1/R1）决定研究质量，检索广度决定信息覆盖，</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>引用纪律决定可信度</span></strong><span>——三者缺一不可。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、常驻 Agent（Resident / Background Agent）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.1 是什么</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>不是「问一次答一次」，而是</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>长期驻留运行</span></strong><span>：监听外部事件、周期巡检、按时触发任务；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>场景：监控告警、定时报告、竞品跟踪、邮件/消息自动响应、数据巡检；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>与「即时 Agent」的区别：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>生命周期</span></strong><span>——小时/天/月级持续运行，而非单次会话。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.2 原理拆解</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>组件</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>说明</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>触发机制</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>事件驱动（消息/文件/告警到达触发）或定时（cron/周期）或轮询（查状态）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>状态保持</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>跨轮次的状态持久化（任务进度、已处理事件去重）——记忆 03 篇的长时记忆</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>循环控制</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>每轮「感知→决策→行动→校验」循环，且要处理空转/去重/幂等</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>健康与自愈</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>异常退出重启、超时挂起、失败升级人工（07 篇）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>通知</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>关键节点主动通知主人（不该打扰的别打扰、该打扰的必达）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.3 工程要点（常驻是最难的工程）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>幂等</span></strong><span>：同一事件触发两次不能重复执行副作用（发两次邮件）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>去重</span></strong><span>：事件去重键（event-id）+ 时间窗；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>停滞检测</span></strong><span>：多轮无进展要自我报告（对齐「停滞监测」思想，衔接 02 篇反思）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>资源控制</span></strong><span>：单轮 token/时间预算上限——常驻 = 无限轮 × 每轮都要便宜；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>退出与升级</span></strong><span>：明确「什么时候算完、什么时候该找人」。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：常驻 Agent = 把「运维纪律」搬进 Agent</span></strong><span>幂等、去重、停滞检测、健康检查——这些是传统后台服务的工程纪律，现在要套在「会自主决策的模型」上。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>常驻 Agent 的难点不在 AI，在可靠性与治理。</span></strong></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>研究 Agent</span></strong><span>：规划→搜索→综合→引用四步；引用纪律是对抗幻觉第一防线。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>研究质量 = 推理深度 × 检索广度 × 引用纪律</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>常驻 Agent</span></strong><span>：事件/定时/轮询三触发；生命周期长——「一直在线」。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>常驻工程纪律</span></strong><span>：幂等、去重、停滞检测、资源预算、退出升级。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>应用全景</span></strong><span>：编码（稳）/ CUA（广）/ 研究（深）/ 常驻（久）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>四类形态覆盖 Agent 的全部使用方式</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、下一篇预告</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 11 篇（板块五·平台，系列收官）：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 框架与协议标准</span></strong><span>——把前面所有原理装进工具：LangGraph / OpenAI Agents SDK / Claude Agent SDK / CrewAI / Microsoft Agent Framework / Google ADK 全对比 + MCP/A2A 协议标准化路径 + 选型指南。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>从「懂原理」到「会选型、能搭建」。</span></strong></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] ChatGPT Deep Research：</span><span>https://openai.com/index/introducing-deep-research/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Gemini Deep Research：</span><span>https://blog.google/products/gemini/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Anthropic Deep Research / Claude：</span><span>https://www.anthropic.com/news</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[参考] 常驻 Agent / goal-resident 形态（goal 驱动运行模式）</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方发布说明。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><m